    // (0x4e3cd0, dc 0xd4390); GetNecromancyCreature has NO Dreamcast
    // row - its name is HD-crossbuild + IDA lineage only, PROVISIONAL.
    float GetNecromancyFactor(unsigned char apply_limit);
